OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHeavy rain will move across
OL,6,FScotland, Wales and England, with some
OL,7,Fintense bursts and perhaps hail in the
OL,8,Feast. This will clear into the North
OL,9,FSea later. Elsewhere, it will be dry
OL,10,Fwith sunny spells. Feeling warm in the
OL,11,Fsoutheast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers in the north will
OL,14,Fsoon fade, leaving a dry night for
OL,15,Fmost. Turning rather chilly under
OL,16,Fclearing skies, with a local grass
OL,17,Ffrost possible in a few rural spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
