OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FDry and settled with sunny
OL,6,Fspells for many. Becoming cloudier
OL,7,Ffrom the west through the day, with
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain reaching Northern
OL,9,FIreland and western Scotland later.
OL,10,FFeeling warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
